  "Oliv.ai defines three maturity levels: Augmented (AI drafts, human does the work), Assisted (agents execute, humans approve before shipping), and Autonomous (agents run end to end, humans handle exceptions); it claims one operator runs about '1.2 humans plus 20 agents' doing the work of 10 GTMs.": 1,
  "Oliv.ai describes a sales multi-agent system with three layers: a commoditised data layer capturing activity, a fine-tuned LLM intelligence layer extracting signals like MEDDICC, and specialist agents coordinated by an orchestrator producing follow-ups, reports and next steps.": 1
